WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.270
Brought to you by Guodong Subs

00:00:10.470 --> 00:00:13.640
We do not own the copyright. Only for academic exchange purpose.
Welcome to watch it on the official channel

00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:53.270
Fu*k, power failure again?

00:00:53.270 --> 00:00:55.470
Hey,You Newbie, go to the rooftop and check the circuit.

00:00:55.470 --> 00:00:57.350
But I just lie down!
*'Lie down' - short rest on bed, chair etc

00:00:57.350 --> 00:00:57.370
But I just lie down!

00:00:57.750 --> 00:00:59.310
Bullshit, you are the newbie here!

00:00:59.310 --> 00:01:00.390
You should go, it's how things work!

00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:06.500
Alright.. alright.. Master Li, I was wrong. I will go now.

00:01:06.870 --> 00:01:10.350
Newbie, working with this attitude someday you will be trouble.

00:01:25.950 --> 00:01:27.310
Come on!

00:01:28.620 --> 00:01:30.580
Let's see what is 'Heavenly Tribulation'

00:01:39.750 --> 00:01:41.160
Damn Old Geezer!

00:01:41.540 --> 00:01:43.950
How can he be so rude to me? I just arrived today.

00:01:44.750 --> 00:01:48.000
What to do? I need this job.. so i have to swallow my pride!

00:01:54.790 --> 00:01:57.120
Eh, why the door is opened?

00:01:59.290 --> 00:02:00.790
Thieves..?!

00:02:09.910 --> 00:02:11.290
Who's here?

00:02:24.660 --> 00:02:25.600
Oh my!

00:02:40.040 --> 00:02:40.830
Hey You!

00:02:42.540 --> 00:02:44.200
Hey, are you all right?

00:02:45.790 --> 00:02:47.040
What should I do?

00:02:48.410 --> 00:02:49.580
Pretend not to see her?

00:03:01.830 --> 00:03:04.200
First Aid in TV all do it like this.

00:03:04.830 --> 00:03:06.250
It seems she needs help,

00:03:06.620 --> 00:03:09.000
but how can i touch a girl, when she is unconscious?

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:11.620
Since, I am a gentleman. I don't have any evil intention.

00:03:13.290 --> 00:03:15.080
Anyway, Emergency first.

00:03:32.380 --> 00:03:37.660
My Cultivator Girlfriend

00:03:42.700 --> 00:03:44.640
I remember I was passing the tribulation,

00:03:44.660 --> 00:03:46.220
and was interrupted by someone else.

00:03:51.660 --> 00:03:52.470
Mom!

00:03:54.160 --> 00:03:56.120
Mom, wait for me!

00:03:58.660 --> 00:04:00.520
Don't leave me!

00:04:19.200 --> 00:04:20.140
It's a misunderstanding.

00:04:21.700 --> 00:04:22.950
please listen to me..

00:04:22.950 --> 00:04:23.870
Let me explain!

00:04:23.950 --> 00:04:27.450
I gave you my first kiss to save you -

00:04:27.450 --> 00:04:29.420
You cant' be ungrateful since i saved you!

00:04:33.680 --> 00:04:34.910
Your first kiss...

00:04:37.140 --> 00:04:39.500
Isn't my first kiss important?

00:04:41.770 --> 00:04:44.250
So... so we are both same.

00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:46.250
We are equal now.

00:04:46.250 --> 00:04:47.120
None of us is in debt,

00:04:47.120 --> 00:04:47.540
right?
None of us is in debt,

00:04:47.540 --> 00:04:48.330
right?

00:04:50.250 --> 00:04:53.040
But I saved you,

00:04:53.290 --> 00:04:56.540
how can you still beat me?! You violent girl!

00:04:58.290 --> 00:04:59.370
Violent? Then Violent.

00:04:59.620 --> 00:05:00.950
Hope we never see each other again.

00:05:14.750 --> 00:05:16.250
I got careless,

00:05:17.040 --> 00:05:19.080
but it's good that he didn't see the Heavenly Tribulation.

00:05:21.540 --> 00:05:24.080
The Cultivation World is ruled by the law of jungle.

00:05:27.160 --> 00:05:28.620
If a mortal ever gets involved,

00:05:28.620 --> 00:05:30.080
they will sure die.

00:05:31.660 --> 00:05:33.120
My power...

00:05:44.450 --> 00:05:46.500
Even I had failed in passing the tribulation,

00:05:46.500 --> 00:05:48.910
Why did my cultivation reduced to the previous levels?

00:05:51.410 --> 00:05:52.580
At this rate -

00:05:52.580 --> 00:05:55.200
all i have worked will be wasted!

00:05:59.830 --> 00:06:00.660
No..

00:06:01.660 --> 00:06:03.160
I must check this out as soon as possible.

00:06:04.450 --> 00:06:05.910
So.. so hot.

00:06:05.910 --> 00:06:08.290
So hot...

00:06:19.410 --> 00:06:21.120
I'm so hungry, shall we to a restaurant?

00:06:21.120 --> 00:06:21.830
Ok~

00:06:24.700 --> 00:06:27.080
Even I don't know what's going on,

00:06:27.080 --> 00:06:28.040
but,

00:06:28.040 --> 00:06:30.330
I feeling more refreshed than before,

00:06:30.330 --> 00:06:32.790
also more clear eyesight as well.

00:06:33.580 --> 00:06:37.080
I can see it from here very clearly, HE-HE-HE

00:06:37.580 --> 00:06:38.790
She is...

00:06:41.620 --> 00:06:42.750
That Violent girl -

00:06:44.040 --> 00:06:47.080
Muzi, you finally come~

00:07:06.080 --> 00:07:09.000
Such a violent girl like her also have fans?

00:07:13.370 --> 00:07:15.080
A new cultivator..

00:07:15.750 --> 00:07:18.790
Let me see your ability.

00:07:23.660 --> 00:07:24.370
Muzi!~

00:07:25.660 --> 00:07:28.290
Today is the first day of movie 'DE Marcia seduce Ultraman 2'

00:07:29.580 --> 00:07:31.160
I booked the whole cinema

00:07:31.160 --> 00:07:32.500
Let's watch it together!

00:07:41.290 --> 00:07:45.000
It sounds like a stupid movie. Who's going to watch that?

00:07:46.790 --> 00:07:49.080
I have some interest on that movie,

00:07:49.330 --> 00:07:50.830
but I have class today.

00:07:52.660 --> 00:07:54.870
Even this violent girl has someone to chase with,

00:07:54.870 --> 00:07:56.790
it's really sad to think!

00:07:57.040 --> 00:07:59.870
Next month i will take leave, let's go on a holiday!

00:08:03.790 --> 00:08:08.750
Ah? Dating with boyfriends again? Hoes before Bros~

00:08:10.290 --> 00:08:12.790
All right, I won't interrupt you. Have Fun.

00:08:22.790 --> 00:08:24.040
Hey You!

00:08:29.450 --> 00:08:31.200
Quickly, Get of there!

00:08:37.750 --> 00:08:38.450
Catch it up

00:08:58.160 --> 00:08:59.450
Are you alright?

00:09:11.830 --> 00:09:13.250
Where am I?

00:09:21.250 --> 00:09:22.250
You are -

00:09:26.660 --> 00:09:28.620
Violent girl?

00:09:35.040 --> 00:09:35.790
My hands..

00:09:41.290 --> 00:09:42.370
Darling~

00:09:42.870 --> 00:09:44.330
You finally wake up?

00:09:45.450 --> 00:09:47.830
I was waiting for you~

00:09:51.120 --> 00:09:54.330
Then, how do you want to start?

00:09:54.540 --> 00:09:56.750
Violent girl, are you ok?

00:10:02.250 --> 00:10:05.250
Lady, please wait! We can talk slowly! Please put you clothes on!

00:10:05.660 --> 00:10:06.750
It seems...

00:10:07.200 --> 00:10:09.370
the seduction skills that i learned from the movie have failed.

00:10:12.450 --> 00:10:14.370
Anyway, hurry up and wear your clothes properly!

00:10:16.830 --> 00:10:18.580
What do you want to do?

00:10:19.160 --> 00:10:21.290
I'm going to take back what belongs to me!

00:10:22.370 --> 00:10:25.250
I really don't remember what i took from you.

00:10:26.330 --> 00:10:27.040
Hmph!

00:10:28.500 --> 00:10:30.040
I am just a security guard.

00:10:31.080 --> 00:10:33.660
Did you remember how you saved that girl?

00:10:36.120 --> 00:10:38.660
Wait, is that girl fine?

00:10:38.950 --> 00:10:40.000
She's fine..

00:10:40.000 --> 00:10:44.450
Since, you just used my power to save her.

00:10:44.450 --> 00:10:46.790
Your power? What the hell?

00:10:46.790 --> 00:10:48.450
Why would I have that?

00:10:48.790 --> 00:10:49.580
Forget it!

00:10:50.500 --> 00:10:51.200
Actually,

00:10:52.200 --> 00:10:54.790
I am a cultivator.

00:10:57.700 --> 00:10:59.660
So, you're mental in head...Just superb!.....

00:11:10.620 --> 00:11:12.790
Now you know my secrets...

00:11:13.120 --> 00:11:16.330
In front of you there's two options to choose.

00:11:17.000 --> 00:11:18.120
Option No.1-

00:11:18.950 --> 00:11:21.540
die under my 'Black Sky'..

00:11:24.120 --> 00:11:25.120
And as for -

00:11:27.200 --> 00:11:28.660
Option No.2-

00:11:31.500 --> 00:11:33.870
Cultivate with me and become immortal together~

00:11:38.060 --> 00:11:40.960
Waken at nightfall

00:11:41.790 --> 00:11:44.500
It's the whisper of waves

00:11:44.990 --> 00:11:50.190
The scenery outside the window is dyed red by the afterglow

00:11:51.790 --> 00:11:54.650
Scattered time

00:11:55.160 --> 00:11:58.100
Blank mood

00:11:58.590 --> 00:12:03.350
No one is along with me to the dawn time

00:12:05.320 --> 00:12:08.300
Wind is passed

00:12:08.750 --> 00:12:11.300
Ear is listening

00:12:11.350 --> 00:12:17.170
Could I hear the sound of your heart beat?

00:12:18.920 --> 00:12:25.210
Let this wind blows hair to the air

00:12:25.660 --> 00:12:28.280
Pitter-patter is perpetual

00:12:28.590 --> 00:12:32.200
Bit bit drops into my heart

00:12:32.570 --> 00:12:38.590
Rose in the vase rises her white body sideways

00:12:39.020 --> 00:12:44.340
It rejects of dying alone
